<title>LEBANON: Lebanon bank assets up 28 pct in 1996 - Banks Assn.</title>
<headline>Lebanon bank assets up 28 pct in 1996 - Banks Assn.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Total assets of Lebanon's banks rose 27.98 percent during 1996, the Lebanese Banks Association reported on Monday.</p>
<p>The association issued the following banking sector details (in billions of Lebanese pounds, at end of period unless otherwise stated):</p>
<p>		    Dec 95   Oct 96   Nov 96   Dec 96   Dec95-Dec96</p>
<p>									   %</p>
<p>    Total Assets 29,055   34,775   35,784   37,183	27.98</p>
<p>Deposits of Residents and Non-residents</p>
<p>		     23,884   29,062   29,870   30,685	28.47</p>
<p>Claims on Residents and Non-residents</p>
<p>		     10,695   12,613   13,014   13,290	24.26</p>
<p>Beirut editorial (961 1) 602057</p>
</text>
